; THE CRIMSON MISSION (sunspire.temple) - the Crimson Prophet's seat and arena. Content frame,
; moved to Cell.origin by tools/shift_cell_content.py.
;
; Modelled on scenes/regions/ember_crown/arena.tscn. The sanctum is a 28.8 m walled square with its
; gate in the NORTH wall (x -7.2..7.2), where Path_temple_gate arrives. The brazier stands just inside
; the gate and its SpawnOffset raises the Prophet at the sanctum's centre (0, 0, 0).
;
; WARNING LOAD-BEARING NODES (the Iron King's arena rule): Brazier/Summon (BossSummonComponent), AddSpawns/*
; (group "boss_add_spawn"), CrimsonVents/* and Phase2Hook/Phase3Hook (ArenaHookComponent Reveals are
; NodePaths to the vents - renaming a vent breaks the phase telegraph silently). The fighting floor
; inside 10 m of the centre stays bare.

