; CAMPAIGN (WR-spec1-16, 28, 29, 52, 68): the Crimson Mission's flock. MissionChapel is turned a quarter turn so its door faces
; the sanctum (east), which is where the layout's own pair of chapel braziers (x = 19) stand and where the spec puts the deacon.
; The sanctum door the kin route reads is a side door on the outside of the sanctum's north wall, beside the gate: a door in the gate
; itself would shut the arena off from every other route.

